  "result": "I've added `bulkArchiveIssuesSchema` with `BulkArchiveIssuesInput`, `findIssuesByIds` and `bulkArchiveIssues`. I haven't run the type checker or the test suite.\n\n- **`bulkArchiveIssues`:** it follows your rules. Duplicated ids are collapsed first. The `issue:archive` check runs for every archivable issue before any archive or `issue.archived` event happens. It reuses the single-archive `archiveIssue` repository call and emits the same event per issue.\n- **`findIssuesByIds`:** it includes archived rows and loads each issue's label ids, like `findIssueById`.\n- **Not atomic:** the archives run one at a time rather than in a single database transaction. Because the permission check completes before the first archive, a denial can't leave a partial result.\n\nThe changes are in `src/schemas/issue.ts`, `src/server/repositories/issue-repository.ts` and `src/server/services/issue-service.ts`.",
